From b7e7bb63f09b151e74f436a96891e03fffeb6533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Bestas <mkbestas@lineageos.org>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:55:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Use a SurfaceView for the HAL-owned face
 preview

The HAL sizes its camera stream from the surface buffer, so that buffer
must be a size the camera supports. A TextureView always resizes its
SurfaceTexture to the view and with the previous implementation, so
enroll failed on Pixel 7+ because it was requesting a 1008x1008
resulution which is not supported by the camera.

Test: enroll face on Pixel 7 and newer
Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I592df8edcf4940a563c34234d4f028539c068e63
---
 res/layout/face_enroll_enrolling.xml          |  7 ++
 res/values/miku_config.xml                    |  3 +
 .../biometrics/face/FaceEnrollEnrolling.java  |  8 ++
 .../face/FaceEnrollPreviewFragment.java       | 83 +++++++++++++++----
 4 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

